<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 10 bln peseta three-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 10 bln peseta three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint  lead managers Banco Bilbao Vizcaya and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN ESP   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    05.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.14    PAY DATE    05.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	DENOMS (K) 100	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
